Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.66,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 您想來點什麼？ ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,茶。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:10.22,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 茶！茶！茶！茶！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:12.59,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 茶！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.80,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 吃掉我們！吃掉我們！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:20.80,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 從我開始！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:23.47,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 吃掉我們！吃掉我們！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.47,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 也可以吃我！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.88,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 你需要很多蜂蜜，年輕人！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:28.47,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 非常地… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:31.52,Musical,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ 甜！ ♪
